        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lukáš Dlouhý, Oliver Marach, Pavel Vízner, Albert Montañés, Rubén Ramírez Hidalgo, Santiago Ventura, Łukasz Kubot\n- Events: 2007 Brasil Open – Doubles, 2009 Grand Prix Hassan II – Doubles\n- Topics: professional tennis, ATP Tour\n\nFacts:\n- Oliver Marach was born on 16 July 1980 and is an Austrian professional tennis player.\n- Lukáš Dlouhý was born on 9 April 1983 and is a professional Czech tennis player on the ATP Tour.\n- In the 2007 Brasil Open – Doubles, defending champions Lukáš Dlouhý and Pavel Vízner won the final 6–2, 7–6 against Albert Montañés and Rubén Ramírez Hidalgo.\n- In the 2009 Grand Prix Hassan II – Doubles, defending champions Albert Montañés and Santiago Ventura lost in the quarterfinals to Łukasz Kubot and Oliver Marach.",
